e route remains healthy. citeturn246907search0turn246907search1\n\nGiven you already *like* how MiMo behaves, I’m actually happier testing it than fighting a perpetually throttled Qwen route. The Luce audition should test **behavior under your actual stack**, not benchmark prestige."]}, "create_time": 1790217955.838797, "end_turn": true, "id": "0494d911-9b83-4115-9595-df783046396d", "metadata": {"can_save": true, "citations": [], "content_references": [{"alt": "([MiMo](https://mimo.mi.com/docs/en-US/updates/model?utm_source=chatgpt.com))", "end_idx": 233, "error": null, "fallback_items": null, "items": [{"attribution": "MiMo", "attribution_segments": null, "attributions": null, "hue": null, "pub_date": null, "refs": [{"ref_index": 1, "ref_type": "search", "turn_index": 0}, {"ref_index": 5, "ref_type": "search", "turn_index": 0}], "snippet": "", "supporting_websites": [{"attribution": "MiMo", "pub_date": null, "snippet": "", "title": "Xiaomi MiMo Home", "url": "https://mimo.mi.com/?utm_source=chatgpt.com"}], "title": "Xiaomi MiMo Home", "url": "https://mimo.mi.com/docs/en-US/updates/model?utm_source=chatgpt.com"}], "matched_text": "citeturn246907search1turn246907search5", "prefix": null, "prompt_text": null, "refs": [], "safe_urls": ["https://mimo.mi.com/", "https://mimo.mi.com/?utm_source=chatgpt.com", "https://mimo.mi.com/docs/en-US/updates/model", "https://mimo.mi.com/docs/en-US/updates/model?utm_source=chatgpt.com"], "start_idx": 191, "status": "done", "style": null, "type": "grouped_webpages"}, {"alt": "([OPPO](https://www.oppo.com/content/dam/oppo_com/common/mkt/footer/2023-OPPO-Sustainability-Report-EN.pdf?utm_source=chatgpt.com))", "end_idx": 377, "error": null, "fallback_items": null, "items": [{"attribution": "OPPO", "attribution_segments": null, "attributions": null, "hue": null, "pub_date": 1745396494, "refs": [{"ref_index": 24, "ref_type": "search", "turn_index": 0}, {"ref_index": 2, "ref_type": "search", "turn_index": 0}], "snippet": "", "suppor