is not explicitly established\n- correcting model selection requires broad architecture work\n\nDo not silently fall back to Big Pickle.\n\nA failed requested model must be visible as FAILED/BLOCKED, not replaced invisibly by the default model.\n\n==================================================\n11. REQUIRED RETURN\n==================================================\n\nRESULT:\nPASS / PARTIAL / BLOCKED\n\nROOT CAUSE:\nExplain exactly why all OpenCode panes defaulted to Big Pickle.\n\nVITTORIO:\nConfirm native Kimi restored or state blocker.\n\nOPENCode MODEL BINDING:\nExplain the actual supported local mechanism discovered.\n\nFILES CHANGED:\nExact files and purpose.\n\nPROOF:\nReturn actual observed runtime/model for:\n\nChiave\nLuce\nVittorio\n\nThen return current runtime/model for:\nNico\nTalon\nKeel\nFalcon\n\nDo not report config intent as runtime proof.\n\nFINAL VERDICT:\nOne of:\n\nDEVPAD RUNTIME BINDINGS CORRECT AND VERIFIED\n\nDEVPAD IDENTITIES CORRECT — MODEL BINDING PARTIAL\n\nKIMI RESTORED — OPENCode MODEL BINDING BLOCKED\n\nBLOCKED\n\nDo not proceed into additional DevPad features after this pass.\n```\n\nAnd I’d tell Nico one more thing outside the prompt: **don’t “fix” this by putting GLM or Kimi names in the tile headers.** We need the actual spawned runtime to prove it.\n\nThe good news is that this is narrower than it looks. **The hard part—seat → identity home—is working.** We need to repair the final hop:\n\n**identity → launcher → provider/model.**"]}, "create_time": 1790227767.858995, "end_turn": true, "id": "006133e2-0f40-4584-b5d3-ba3b332d0378", "metadata": {"can_save": true, "citations": [], "code_blocks": {"0": {"edited": false, "id": "22c22j", "preview_language": null, "previewable": false}}, "content_references": [], "conversation_followup_suggestions_eligible": true, "cot_version": "v5", "default_model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "finish_details": {"stop_tokens": [200002], "type": "stop"}, "gizmo_id": "g-p-6ab41b7c2620819187c626358eeb