re berth. Strongest structural synthesis / integration reasoning.\n\n## Also materially valued\n\nTwo others were important, but they sat more in **specialist labor roles** than the clearest top-six berth set:\n\n- **Kimi K3 High** — methodology challenger\n- **Big Pickle** — verification specialist\n\nSo the Black Pearl takeaway was basically:\n\n**Don’t ask “which model is smartest?”**  \nAsk:\n\n- who is best at first-pass grounding?\n- who is best at anomaly detection?\n- who is best at contradiction checking?\n- who is best at architecture?\n- who is best at methodology challenge?\n- who is best at verification?\n\nFor the AI convergence lane specifically, that top-six bench is the cleanest anchor:\n\n**GPT-5.6 Sol / Nex N2.5 Pro / Muse Spark 1.3 / Dots3 Note Preview / Grok 4.6 / GLM 5.1**. memcite"]}, "create_time": 1790261141.234087, "end_turn": true, "id": "d62b3408-9220-4fff-b118-53fa716b696c", "metadata": {"can_save": true, "citations": [], "content_references": [{"alt": null, "end_idx": 1615, "invalid": false, "matched_text": "memcite", "prefix": null, "prompt_text": null, "refs": [], "safe_urls": [], "start_idx": 1606, "type": "hidden"}], "conversation_context_citation_metadata": [{"citation": {"alt": "", "attribution": "Past chat", "category": "memory", "end_idx": 0, "matched_text": "", "prompt_text": null, "pub_date": 1790116104.686, "refs": [], "retrieval_origin": "pca", "snippet": "DATE: 2026-09-22\\\nSESSION: New Chat Bootstrap — Kimi Desktop Experimental MLB\\\nPROJECT: EC8 - Edge Crew\\\nSEAT CONTEXT: Coda governance / Don final authority\\\nLANE: Experimental MLB pressure-test\n\n# PURPOSE\n\nCreate a separate conversational lane called:\n\n**Kimi Desktop Experimental MLB**\n\nThis chat exists so Don can use the existing Kimi Desktop / legacy Quant environment for live MLB analysis, paper experimentation, methodology pressure-testing, and fun without contaminating the authoritative Parent Quant build currently frozen in the terminal lane.\n\n